500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갈까","audio":"/audio/0e3718549837ff797d8c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"b6036f634bebefe0","term":"귤","zh":"橘子","audio":"/audio/b6036f634bebefe025fc.mp3","entryId":"37057","definition":"橘子树的果实，圆形，呈黄色或橘黄色，去皮可食用，味道酸甜。","pronunciation":["귤"]},{"id":"699ce35da5829254","term":"자몽","zh":"西柚","audio":"/audio/699ce35da58292545ddb.mp3","entryId":"73545","definition":"和橘子类似，有强烈的酸味和香味，果肉柔软多汁的水果。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e7e01f6589be88eb1ac3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.83,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=65768","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":101,"sequenceScore":2.6567,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那要不买些橘子或西柚回去？","最近我总想吃酸的东西呢。","我打算去市政府，要怎么走呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["最近我总想吃酸的东西呢。","我打算去市政府，要怎么走呢？","那要不买些橘子或西柚回去？"],"answer":2}]}
